# ===========================
# PKL files — TRACKED (important model files!)
# ===========================
# NOTE: .pkl files are NOT ignored.
# They contain trained classifiers (clf_*.pkl) and
# label encoders (enc_*.pkl) that are essential for
# the pipeline to function. They WILL be pushed.
#
# ⚠️  Some are very large (clf_palm.pkl ~538MB).
#     You may need Git LFS for files over 100MB:
#       git lfs install
#       git lfs track "*.pkl"
#
